Exchange market data

This software reads public market-data endpoints of third-party cryptocurrency
exchanges. It bundles, caches and redistributes none of that data: every query
is a live request made from the user's machine, so the user is the API caller.
The market data it returns belongs to the respective exchanges, is not covered
by the MIT License above, and is subject to each exchange's terms of use and
geographic restrictions.

Neither this software nor Query Farm LLC is affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by CCXT or any exchange it connects to. Exchange names are trademarks
of their respective owners and are used here only to describe what this
software connects to.
